/bin/
/dist
*.test
*.out

!.claude/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# awf renders a CLAUDE.md @AGENTS.md bridge at the repo root (ADR-0016);
# negate the user's global CLAUDE.md ignore so the rendered artifact commits.
!CLAUDE.md

# Keep shared repository infrastructure and Pi adapter output visible despite
# common global ignores.
!.github/
!.pi/
.pi/awf-subagents.local.json

# Per-checkout maintainer caches, including golangci-lint and context-spill
# observability, are operator-owned and never committed.
/.cache/

# awf preserves a pre-existing hand-written file at <path>.awf-bak rather than
# clobbering it on render. That is a local rescue copy of superseded content, so
# it is never committed; one reached main before this rule existed.
*.awf-bak
